t_fib):\n            # If it's a Fibonacci number, check if it's also prime.\n            if is_prime(next_fib):\n                fib_count += 1\n                if fib_count == n:\n                    return next_fib\n\n        # Generate the next Fibonacci number in the sequence for the next iteration.\n        a, b = b, a + b"}
