{"task_id": "HumanEval/44", "solution": "def change_base(x: int, base: int) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Change numerical base of input number x to base.\n    Returns string representation after the conversion.\n    \"\"\"\n    if x == 0:\n        return '0'\n\n    is_negative = False\n    if x < 0:\n        is_negative = True\n        x = -x\n\n    result = []\n    while x > 0:\n        remainder = x % base\n        result.append(str(remainder))\n        x //= base\n\n    if is_negative:\n        result.append('-')\n\n    return ''.join(result[::-1])"}
