{"task_id": "HumanEval/49", "solution": "def modp(n: int, p: int):\n    \"\"\"Return 2^n modulo p using modular exponentiation by squaring.\n    Handles large n and p efficiently without overflow.\"\"\"\n\n    if p == 1:\n        return 0\n\n    result = 1\n    base = 2 % p\n\n    current_n = n\n    while current_n > 0:\n        if current_n % 2 == 1:  # If the current bit of the exponent is 1\n            result = (result * base) % p\n        base = (base * base) % p  # Square the base\n        current_n //= 2  # Divide the exponent by 2 (right shift)\n\n    return result"}
